    "commit_message": "* chore(bundlesize): update margins\r\n\r\n* fix(routing): take initial UI state in account if widgets aren't yet mounted\r\n\r\n* feat(routing): allow createURL with IndexUiState callback\r\n\r\n* fix(refinementList): use UiState based routing\r\n\r\n* fix(pagination): use UiState based routing\r\n\r\n* fix(breadcrumb): use UiState based routing\r\n\r\n* test(routing): use router in tests\r\n\r\n* test(common): add tests for createURL for several widgets (#5694)\r\n\r\n* test(common): add tests for createURL for several widgets\r\n\r\n* use lambda for connectHierarchicalMenu\r\n\r\n* add test with initial URL\r\n\r\n* test(url): add common tests with multiple widgets\r\n\r\nFX-2450\r\n\r\n* fix(rendering): render if status has changed\r\n\r\n* test(url): introduce 'skippable' describe\r\n\r\nthis is useful for currentrefinements which works but with a warning/error and not completely right for the first render in react instantsearch hooks\r\n\r\n* !fixup\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: Aymeric Giraudet <aymeric.giraudet@algolia.com>",
